# Contabo soft CPU pin — kube play does not persist HostConfig
# CpusetCpus or process nice. Re-applied after /health by
# scripts/apply-fullstack-soft-pin.sh.
#
# DRAFT ONLY. Do not merge, tag, or apply on Contabo until unanimous
# seat critical +1s + CoS. Floki MOVE NO. Cutover happens only via
# update.sh after merge + tag + Robert/CoS go.
#
# Host snapshot (Release, locked): nproc=6, CPUs 0–5.
#
# =============================================================================
# APPLY-READY DEFAULT = packing B (Robert's final pick; no shrink)
# =============================================================================
# fullstack HostConfig stays 2-5 / nice -5 (live Contabo today).
# SEND 0-1 is in-process only (kube env → voice-rt wire-send threads).
# DECODE 2-5 is kube music env. decode-rt (pipeline/fetch/bridge/resolve)
# pins itself there. Children inherit it via pre_exec sched_setaffinity
# before exec (pin_decode_child is only a leader backup). Share Axum,
# never on send 0-1. soft-pin.env cannot inject DECODE into a running
# process.
# Music HostConfig UNSET (or 0-5). Never HostConfig-only 0-1 (packing C).
# Do NOT set TS6_SOFT_PIN_SHRINK_ACK=1. Do NOT make fullstack 4-5
# apply-ready (that is packing A, gated comment only).
#
# Baseline dig (Angerfist, v1.6.15 option-1, music container wide):
#   und/C/stall per min 163/590/117 — worse than Sep17 soft-pin-only
#   HS PASS 133/248/60. Dominant C_loop_deferral; full buffer 249.
# Hypothesis (non-binding): parking DECODE on 2-5 (share fullstack)
# is better than sharing send 0-1; exclusive 2-3 needs a shrink (A).

# --- B (apply-ready; Robert picked; no fullstack shrink) ---
TS6_FULLSTACK_CPUSET=2-5
TS6_FULLSTACK_NICE=-5

TS6_BOT_CPUSET=0-1
TS6_BOT_SEND_CPUSET=0-1
TS6_BOT_NICE=-5
# music HostConfig unset (B). apply-fullstack-soft-pin.sh refuses ANY
# TS6_BOT_CONTAINER_CPUSET under packing B, not only literal 0-1.
# SEND 0-1 / DECODE 2-5 stay in-process. A wider HostConfig (0-3) is
# packing A and needs a fullstack shrink plus TS6_SOFT_PIN_SHRINK_ACK=1.
# TS6_BOT_CONTAINER_CPUSET=0-5
# DECODE lives in kube music env (2-5). Documented here only:
# TS6_BOT_DECODE_CPUSET=2-5

# Sidecar stays unpinned (do not steal send cores for MoQ).
# TS6_SIDECAR_CPUSET=
# TS6_SIDECAR_NICE=

# Host-side SCHED_FIFO / SCHED_RR via chrt — OPT-IN, default off.
# In-process setpriority as uid 10001 is EPERM without CAP_SYS_NICE;
# do not pretend the music process can renice itself. Host renice
# (TS6_BOT_NICE above) must hit voice-rt tids — renice -p on the
# container pid only changes the thread-group leader. The walk is
# one-shot (update.sh after music /health, Opus #66 L16). It does not
# survive a music container restart. Tokio blocking-pool threads reuse
# comm voice-rt and are created lazily; they inherit the spawning
# thread's nice, so a parent this walk already reniced passes that
# nice on, and a parent still at 0 does not. Re-run
# apply-fullstack-soft-pin.sh to catch tids that exist then. Do not
# add CAP_SYS_NICE. Packing B values above stay. Floki MOVE NO.
# RT needs proven need + usually CAP_SYS_NICE or rootful host chrt;
# no kube privileged default.
# TS6_BOT_CHRT_SCHED=
# TS6_BOT_CHRT_PRIO=

# Shrink ACK — required by apply-fullstack-soft-pin.sh if someone
# enables packing A (fullstack 4-5 / 3-5). Default UNSET.
# TS6_SOFT_PIN_SHRINK_ACK=1

# =============================================================================
# Profile A — gated shrink alt ONLY (not default; ignore earlier A ping)
# =============================================================================
# Exclusive DECODE 2-3 needs fullstack shrink to free 2-3:
#   fullstack HostConfig → 4-5 / nice -5  (3-5 if 4-5 too tight)
#   SEND 0-1 in-process
#   DECODE 2-3 via kube + pin_decode_child
#   music HostConfig prefer 0-3
# Overnight risk: shrinking fullstack may regress Panel/API/Surreal.
# Requires Robert + TS6_SOFT_PIN_SHRINK_ACK=1 + kube DECODE=2-3.
#
# TS6_FULLSTACK_CPUSET=4-5
# TS6_BOT_CONTAINER_CPUSET=0-3
# TS6_BOT_DECODE_CPUSET=2-3
# TS6_SOFT_PIN_SHRINK_ACK=1

# =============================================================================
# Profile C — REJECT
# =============================================================================
# music HostConfig 0-1 + DECODE on send cores. v1.6.15 + Angerfist
# dig proved container-wide 0-1 traps ffmpeg on send cores / C_loop
# got worse. apply-fullstack-soft-pin.sh refuses send-only music
# HostConfig.
